.cicd
.git*
.vscode
Dockerfile*

# -ios carrier only needs the xcarchive; drop the 36k+ Xcode intermediate
# files under build/ios/ (grpc-fuse sends them one-by-one on Docker Desktop and
# the self-hosted-mac local packaging step hangs for 20+ min). Keeps build/app
# (android AAB) and build/web (web) untouched.
build/ios/*
!build/ios/archive
